  unitName: Great Sage Mimir
  unitId: 50042
  unitNumber: 285
  description: A white mage that was active in the ruined La Veda Republic during
    the ancient war. By the time the war with the gods had started, her healing powers
    had grown miraculously strong. She freely wielded her powers saving countless
    people who in turn called her a saint, to which she simply smiled. She would
    never accept payment for her services, but it's said she would take sweet treats,
    albeit after a bit of hesitation.
  summonDesc: I see healing powers are needed.<br>Of course I'll lend mine to you.<br>Alright,
    let's save the people!
  fusionDesc: My healing light grows!<br>With this power I can save<br>even more
    people!
  evoDesc: Can you see how the light<br>has grown strong inside me?<br>It shines
    along with you!
  element: 5
  rarity: 2
